      "71": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "DEMULTIPLY ALPHA & PREMULTIPLY ALPHA\n\nThese nodes can be used to demultiply or premultiply the alpha channel of the incomming texture.\n\nThis is commonly used when a texture of image is imported into Wire and has the wrong alpha.\n\nWe try to make sure that every imported texture is interpreted correctly, but if something is wrong with your alphas you might be able to correct them with these nodes."
          }
        },
